@startuml UC_Validate_Privacy_Consent
title C4 Level 4 - Code Diagram: Validate Privacy Consent

class Patient <<Actor>>

package "iHOMIS Portal (React/Next.js)" {
    class iHOMISConsent <<ReactComponent>> {
        + consentSigned: boolean
        + handleSave()
    }
}

package "WAH Hospital (React/Next.js)" {
    class WAHConsent <<ReactComponent>> {
        + consentSigned: boolean
        + handleSave()
    }
}

package "ADAPT iPaaS Middleware (Golang)" {
    class IngestHandler <<struct>> {
        + mongoRepo: MongoDBRepository
        + HandleIngest(w: ResponseWriter, r: Request)
    }

    class MongoDBRepository <<struct>> {
        + InsertQuarantinedTransaction(tx: Transaction, msg: String)
    }
}

Patient --> iHOMISConsent : signs consent
Patient --> WAHConsent : signs consent

iHOMISConsent --> IngestHandler : submits payload
WAHConsent --> IngestHandler : submits payload

IngestHandler --> MongoDBRepository : quarantines unconsented payload
IngestHandler ..> Patient : returns 422 (if denied)

@enduml
